An ooze lives in the mid-boughs of the [[Verdant Expanse]] near where travellers enter from [[Geography/Calaria/Wrenford|Wrenford]]. Its only sign is a faint, almost mucus-like residue left on the trees where it has passed. Nobody has yet seen what kind it is.
